    "title": "Какие профессии не могут получить разрешение на работу?",
    "content": "<p>It является not possible к grant разрешение на работуs к иностранецs in professions и duties reserved only for турецкие граждане in  relevant laws. Accordingly, professions for which разрешение на работуs cannot be obtained следующие:</p><ul>\n<li>Founders, Managers, Trainers of Private Security Companies и Representatives Authorized by  Corporate Partner of  Company,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Private Security Officers,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Market и Neighbourhood Watchmanship,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Certified Public Accountancy,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cooperative Board Members,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customs Broker Assistant,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Founders of Schools Teaching in Languages Other Than Turkish и Opened by Foreign Nationals,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Responsible Manager in Private Hospitals,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dentistry, Patient Care,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pharmacy,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Veterinary Medicine,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Foreign Assistants Working Outside Speciality Training,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Notary,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Judgeship и Prosecution,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Legal Practice,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mediation,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Expert Witness,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Concordat Commissariat,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trainee Aviation Information Management Officer,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Honorary Traffic Inspector,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Freight Forwarding Organisation,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Agency Manager, Travel Agency Manager,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tourist Guiding,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Export of Fish, Oyster, Mussel, Sponge, Pearl, Coral в течение Territorial Waters, Diving, Searching, Pilotage, Captaincy, Net Fishing, Clerkship, Deckhand etc.,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sports Consultancy,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Job Placement in Agriculture,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ship Agency Officer и Ship Agency Personnel,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Permanent Supervisor, Technical Officer.</li>\n</ul><p>Jobs и professions that only турецкие граждане может perform under various laws и regulations являются listed выше. Иностранецs может not apply for foreign разрешение на работуs in these occupational fields.</p>"
